OL,3,GNEWSAKiller of boy, 12, ordered to face
OL,4,Avictim's family at sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile it had been thought he could not
OL,7,Fbe compelled to attend the hearing,
OL,8,FCoventry MP Taiwo Owatemi said the
OL,9,Fjudge had now ordered him to appear in
OL,10,Fperson following representations to the
OL,11,Fjustice minister on the family's
OL,12,Fbehalf.
